OL,3,GNEWSANew Bristol railway station
OL,4,Aopening date announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening date for a new railway
OL,7,Fstation in Bristol designed to serve
OL,8,Fthe new town Brabazon and the future
OL,9,FAviva Arena has been announced.
OL,11,FBristol Brabazon Station - near the
OL,12,Fsite of the former North Filton Station
OL,13,F- will welcome its first passengers
OL,14,Fwith an 07:10 service on Monday 23
OL,15,FNovember marking a return to passenger
OL,16,Ftrains on the currently freight-only
OL,17,FHenbury Line.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
