OL,3,GNEWSANew Bristol railway station
OL,4,Aopening date announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn hourly service will run between
OL,7,FBristol Temple Meads and Bristol
OL,8,FBrabazon, also calling at Lawrence
OL,9,FHill, Stapleton Road, Ashley Down and
OL,10,FFilton Abbey Wood.
OL,12,FThere are further plans for a new
OL,13,Fstation at Henbury, which is expected
OL,14,Fto open in 2028.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
